# ===========================================================================
# Google OAuth client for the Hermes agent's Google add-on. OPTIONAL --
# nothing in the base build reads this file.
#
# Copied to config/google.env (0600, gitignored). It stays on this machine:
# nothing here is pushed into the VM. Never commit the filled-in copy, and
# never paste these values into a chat with an agent.
#
# You normally fill in NOTHING here. Download the OAuth client's JSON from
# Google Cloud Console into secrets/ and
#
#     ./scripts/addon-google-hermes.sh auth
#
# reads it, copies the two values below across, asks you to consent in a
# browser, and writes the result as two more files beside this one:
#
#     config/google_token.json           the refresh token -- the actual key
#                                        to the account, and the only copy
#     config/google_client_secret.json   the OAuth client, as Google issued it
#
# Those two are what gets pushed into the VM, under the names Hermes'
# bundled google-workspace skill looks for.
# ===========================================================================

# --- From Google Cloud Console ----------------------------------------------
# An OAuth client of type "Desktop app". Filled in for you from the JSON in
# secrets/; type them by hand only if you would rather not download it.
# See addons/google-hermes/README.md for the console steps, including the
# one that matters most: publish the consent screen. Left in "Testing",
# the refresh token expires after seven days, every time.
GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID=""
GOOGLE_CLIENT_SECRET=""

# --- Written by `addon-google-hermes.sh auth` -------------------------------
# The account that consented, from Google's own userinfo response -- what
# the token really belongs to rather than what you expected.
GOOGLE_ACCOUNT_EMAIL=""

# LEAVE BLANK. Before 2026-11-14 the refresh token was written here as well
# as into google_token.json. It no longer is; the line stays so that an
# older file still reads as "consent done".
GOOGLE_REFRESH_TOKEN=""
